WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:20.110
"What?" Daisy was insulted. "I didn't steal your pony!"

2
00:00:20.111 --> 00:00:24.091
"Yes, you did!" The girl with the braid jutted out her chin.

3
00:00:24.092 --> 00:00:26.157
Henry recognized the girl.

4
00:00:26.158 --> 00:00:29.817
She lived in West Belltown, and her name was Rebecca.

5
00:00:29.818 --> 00:00:34.140
But he didn't know her very well, since she was a grade ahead of him in school.

6
00:00:34.141 --> 00:00:36.639
Rebecca stomped over to the pony.

7
00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:42.104
"Everyone knows I wanted to ride Coco in the show today," she said, giving the pony a hug.

8
00:00:42.105 --> 00:00:46.182
Daisy pulled on the lead rope to move the pony away from Rebecca.

9
00:00:46.183 --> 00:00:50.195
"I wanted to ride her today too," she said.

10
00:00:50.196 --> 00:00:54.404
"I've been riding her in my lessons for the past month."

11
00:00:54.405 --> 00:00:56.926
"Me too," Rebecca said.

12
00:00:56.927 --> 00:01:00.022
"Wait a minute." Henry was confused.

13
00:01:00.023 --> 00:01:05.082
"How can both of you ride the same pony at the same time?"

14
00:01:05.083 --> 00:01:09.049
Daisy looked surprised, as if she'd forgotten Henry was listening.

15
00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:13.008
"We don't ride her at the same time," she said.

16
00:01:13.009 --> 00:01:17.060
"Rebecca and I take lessons on different days."

17
00:01:17.061 --> 00:01:22.280
"Oh," Henry said. Then he remembered something Maggie had told him.

18
00:01:22.281 --> 00:01:26.509
"But wait, why can't you both ride Coco in the show?

19
00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:30.687
Maggie said a boy is riding Big Spot today too."

20
00:01:30.688 --> 00:01:37.650
"Maggie is riding in the beginner classes for people under age eleven," Daisy explained.

21
00:01:37.651 --> 00:01:43.112
"The boy is riding later, in the advanced classes for older riders.

22
00:01:43.113 --> 00:01:48.168
Big Spot will have plenty of time to rest in between classes."

23
00:01:48.169 --> 00:01:51.032
Rebecca nodded, still looking angry.

24
00:01:51.033 --> 00:01:56.585
"My class is right before Daisy's class, so Coco can only do one or the other.

25
00:01:56.586 --> 00:02:00.475
And I was supposed to ride Coco until she stole her!"

26
00:02:00.476 --> 00:02:06.335
Daisy rolled her eyes. "I didn't steal Coco from you," she said.

27
00:02:06.336 --> 00:02:10.931
"We chose straws to decide who'd get to ride her in the show.

28
00:02:10.932 --> 00:02:14.427
You lost when you got the short straw.

29
00:02:14.428 --> 00:02:19.569
It was a fair way to decide, so you should just forget about it!"

30
00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:23.521
"Don't tell me what to do!" Rebecca yelled, clenching her fists.

31
00:02:23.522 --> 00:02:26.107
"Anyway, you'll be sorry!"

32
00:02:26.108 --> 00:02:30.623
She stomped away. Daisy stared after the other girl.

33
00:02:30.624 --> 00:02:36.061
"Wow," she said. "Rebecca seems really mad at me."

34
00:02:36.062 --> 00:02:40.557
Henry nodded. "Do you think she's mad enough to steal your shirt?"

35
00:02:40.558 --> 00:02:46.633
Daisy's eyes widened. "Definitely!" she exclaimed.

36
00:02:46.634 --> 00:02:50.558
"Maybe she thought that would make me drop out of the show.

37
00:02:50.559 --> 00:02:54.614
Then she'd be able to ride Coco after all."

38
00:02:54.615 --> 00:02:58.391
"That seems like a pretty good motive," Henry agreed.

39
00:02:58.392 --> 00:03:02.227
Just then he noticed some people standing by the lemonade stand.

40
00:03:02.228 --> 00:03:05.343
He said good-bye to Daisy and hurried back to work.

41
00:03:05.344 --> 00:03:09.760
Henry thought about the case as he poured lemonade and collected quarters.

42
00:03:09.761 --> 00:03:14.129
Could Rebecca be the shirt thief? She had a good motive.

43
00:03:14.130 --> 00:03:17.449
And it was very busy and crowded at the stable today.

44
00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:21.206
She probably could have grabbed the shirt without anyone seeing her.

45
00:03:21.207 --> 00:03:25.064
Maybe Cole would come back from the barn with some good clues.

46
00:03:25.065 --> 00:03:29.644
"Hello, Henry," a familiar voice said. "How's business?"

47
00:03:29.645 --> 00:03:33.892
Henry looked up. Maggie's father was smiling at him.

48
00:03:33.893 --> 00:03:38.886
"Hi, Uncle Bruce," Henry said. "Would you like some lemonade?"

49
00:03:38.887 --> 00:03:42.843
"Sure." Uncle Bruce reached into his pocket for a quarter.

50
00:03:42.844 --> 00:03:46.795
"I'm getting thirsty standing around waiting to watch Maggie ride."

51
00:03:46.796 --> 00:03:49.362
Henry glanced over at the barn.

52
00:03:49.363 --> 00:03:53.085
"Hey, Uncle Bruce, can you do me a favor?"

53
00:03:53.086 --> 00:03:56.179
"Sure, Henry. What is it?" his uncle said.

54
00:03:56.180 --> 00:04:00.467
"Will you watch the lemonade stand for a few minutes?" Henry said.

55
00:04:00.468 --> 00:04:02.886
"I need to go find Cole."

56
00:04:02.887 --> 00:04:07.145
"No problem." Uncle Bruce stepped behind the table.

57
00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:12.282
"Step right up for Belltown's best lemonade!" he called to a passing woman.

58
00:04:12.283 --> 00:04:20.410
"Thanks," Henry told him. "I'll be back in a few minutes."

59
00:04:20.411 --> 00:04:23.662
When Henry entered the barn, it was very busy.

60
00:04:23.663 --> 00:04:27.010
Ponies were standing in stalls and tied in the aisles.

61
00:04:27.011 --> 00:04:31.271
Lots of kids were running around with grooming tools or saddles and bridles.

62
00:04:31.272 --> 00:04:35.390
Henry dodged around a fat brown pony, looking for Cole.

63
00:04:35.391 --> 00:04:39.773
He didn't see Cole, but he spotted Maggie near Big Spot's stall.

64
00:04:39.774 --> 00:04:43.485
"Have you seen Cole?" Henry asked, hurrying over.

65
00:04:43.486 --> 00:04:46.818
"Nope." Maggie fiddled with her pony's halter.

66
00:04:46.819 --> 00:04:50.184
"Haven't seen him since I left the lemonade stand."

67
00:04:50.185 --> 00:04:53.205
"That's weird," Henry muttered.

68
00:04:53.206 --> 00:04:56.912
Then he noticed Daisy leading her pony into the barn.

69
00:04:56.913 --> 00:05:01.064
She stopped in front of a stall a few doors down from Big Spot's.

70
00:05:01.065 --> 00:05:04.804
"Is that Coco's stall?" Henry asked Maggie.

71
00:05:04.805 --> 00:05:09.516
"Yeah," Maggie said. "You should go look for clues there."

72
00:05:09.517 --> 00:05:12.561
"That's what Cole is supposed to be doing."

73
00:05:12.562 --> 00:05:15.536
Henry started walking toward Coco's stall.

74
00:05:15.537 --> 00:05:21.670
But he had to stop when a dark-haired girl led a dapple-gray pony out of the stall next to Big Spot's.

75
00:05:21.671 --> 00:05:24.733
"Excuse me," the girl said with a smile.

76
00:05:24.734 --> 00:05:26.503
Henry smiled back.

77
00:05:26.504 --> 00:05:30.350
The girl was about Daisy's age, but he didn't recognize her.

78
00:05:30.351 --> 00:05:33.030
Suddenly Henry's smile faded.

79
00:05:33.031 --> 00:05:39.460
The girl's shirt had long sleeves, a high collar, and a strip of polka-dotted ribbon on the front pocket.

80
00:05:39.461 --> 00:05:46.696
"You!" he blurted out. "You took Daisy's show shirt!"
